# maps on their way to the agreement-templates bucket.
/esign-out/

# Written by `next dev` (Next 16.4) on every start, in every worktree. Left
# untracked, it blocks the unforced `git worktree remove` that ship, promote
# and close-out rely on, so a merged worktree stays behind (16 Oct 2026).
# CLAUDE.md is the agent brief for this repo.
/AGENTS.md

# Supabase CLI scratch state — rewritten by every `supabase link`, and
# per-machine. Tracking it made every session that linked a project produce a
# spurious diff, and two sessions linking different projects conflict.
supabase/.temp/

